{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#card-zh","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-glass（DSH 桌面插件）：为桌面界面营造蓝色半透明毛玻璃效果。它通过浏览器端注入样式，让页面底色和侧栏透出窗口材质，为侧栏、中列和右栏添加渐变，并移除若干分隔线；面板挂载时还会淡入上浮，并尊重系统减少动态效果设置。适合希望调整 DSH 桌面外观的用户。Windows 上要看到桌面壁纸，还需单独应用窗口材质补丁；无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-89","windows-acrylic/make-acrylic.mjs:83-99"]}
{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#card-en","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-glass (DSH desktop plugin) adds a translucent blue appearance. It softens page and sidebar backgrounds, adds column gradients, removes selected dividers, and animates panel entry with reduced-motion support. Showing wallpaper on Windows also requires the separate window-material patch.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-89","windows-acrylic/make-acrylic.mjs:83-99"]}
