{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-1","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-glass 的功能「半透明页面」：将页面底色和侧栏填充改为半透明颜色，并令 Windows 桌面布局的窗口框架和对话根容器透明，配合窗口材质显示玻璃效果。通过安装插件启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-39","lib/client.js:59-75"]}
{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-2","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-glass 的功能「列渐变与边界调整」：为侧栏、中列和右栏设置不同方向的渐变，并移除中列圆角、导航下划线、dock 左边线和侧栏右边界。插件加载后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:59-88"]}
{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-3","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-glass 的功能「窗口材质补丁」：在 Windows 主窗口启用 acrylic 或 mica 材质与透明背景。运行配套脚本后，壁纸可透过窗口显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["windows-acrylic/make-acrylic.mjs:83-99","windows-acrylic/make-acrylic.mjs:132-165","windows-acrylic/apply-acrylic.ps1:28-33"]}
{"unit_id":"JianHeShui__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-4","repo":"JianHeShui/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"1be8d499c38b6f9934efcd0034e3f452b06b6c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-glass 的功能「面板进入动画」：中间和右侧列中的子面板挂载时淡入并轻微上浮；系统启用减少动态效果时关闭动画。安装插件后自动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:40-53","lib/client.js:91-110"]}
